{"id":"vod_lz_57187","vodId":"57187","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"狼与香辛料第一季","name_cn":"狼与香辛料第一季","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230411-1/9237844ca2a1a5b6504f03cbacf72d63.jpg"},"summary":"　　在世界各地旅行并收购贩卖物品的旅行商人克拉福•劳伦斯在经过正在庆祝收获节的帕斯罗村后离开，却在自己堆满麦束的货车上发现了正在睡觉的少女。少女有狼的耳朵和尾巴，更有美丽的脸庞，她自报家门称自己是掌管丰收的狼神“赫萝”。　　虽然对这样的介绍半信半疑，但在赫萝的花言巧语之下，劳伦斯答应带赫萝回到遥远的北方故乡，就这样二人展开了旅行商人的旅程，并在行商途中遇到了各式各样的事件。　　赫萝的出现，改变了劳伦斯原本孤独的经商生活。虽然常常被赫萝狡猾的言论捉弄，但他与赫萝的羁绊也因此越来越深","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-11 22:58:31","classic":true,"classicRank":31,"franchise":"狼与香辛料","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16109_37fb5646/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16108_363e7f73/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16110_922a1a55/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16107_d287107f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16111_97709363/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16112_d392a381/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16113_b8f89674/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16114_948e74ce/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16115_998417bc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16116_1cabdb97/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16117_71df7dfe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230410/16118_b3fbcd85/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:06.143Z"}